    <string name="help_message">Use the keypad and tap = for the result. Open ☰ for every mode and History; tap ⋮ for theme, updates, favourites, and more. Toggle Scientific mode above the keypad for extra functions.</string>
    <string name="help_content_full">• Side menu (☰): Tap the menu button or Switch mode on the calculator to choose a screen—Basic, Temperature, EMI, Interest, Currency, Tax, Date, BMI, Discount, Unit converter, Number Target Puzzle, Memory Number Grid, Math Speed Game, AI Smart, Favourites, or History.\n\n• Overflow (⋮): Clear history, Check for updates, Choose theme (Light / Dark / System), Privacy policy, Send feedback, Add to favourites, Share app, Rate &amp; review, and Help.\n\n• Basic calculator: Numbers and operators (+, −, ×, ÷), = , AC, and parentheses. Turn on Scientific mode above the keypad for √, π, powers, sin/cos/tan, ln/log, and related keys.\n\n• History: Open History from the side menu. Tap Use on a row to load that calculation.\n\n• Favourites: On supported screens, use Add to favourites from ⋮. Open Favourites from the side menu; swipe left to pin and right to delete.\n\n• AI Smart: Type a question in plain language. The microphone uses voice input when you allow it (the app may ask for permission).\n\n• Locale: Amounts and separators follow your device language/region settings where the mode supports it.</string>
