    <string name="privacy_policy_title">Privacy Policy</string>
    <string name="privacy_policy_content">AI Calculator respects your privacy. This app is built so everyday calculations stay on your phone or tablet.\n\n• Calculations &amp; data on your device: Basic calculator, converters, EMI, tax, interest, date, BMI, discount, games, and similar tools run locally. Calculation history and favourites are saved only on your device and are not uploaded to us.\n\n• AI Smart: Short, simple inputs are handled offline on your device. Longer or natural-language questions may use the internet only if you add your own optional API keys (for example Google Gemini or DeepSeek) in the app; in that case your typed text is sent to that provider to get a response, under that provider’s terms and privacy policy. Without keys or without a network, the app uses local processing instead.\n\n• Voice: If you use the microphone, Android speech recognition may process audio on your device or through Google’s speech services, depending on your device and settings.\n\n• Updates: “Check for updates” uses Google Play’s in-app update flow; Google may process data as described in Play and your Google account settings.\n\n• Feedback: If you email us via Send feedback, we receive only what you choose to send (for example to mollanuramin130@gmail.com) so we can reply.\n\n• We do not run in-app analytics or third-party ad tracking in this app.\n\n• Questions about this policy: mollanuramin130@gmail.com</string>
    <string name="feedback_email_subject">Nur\'s Custom Calculator – Feedback</string>
